# Class Check (before delivery)

Run this checklist on the lesson file. Fix failures before push.

## Sync
- [ ] Full-text paragraphs === gap-fill paragraphs (word-for-word; only blanks differ)
- [ ] Word banks shuffled (not text order); exactly 5 words / 5 blanks per block
- [ ] T/F answerable only from listening text (no outside knowledge traps)

## Grammar
- [ ] Hour’s grammar focus matches `curriculum/25-hours.md` for this class number
- [ ] Grammar Review + Grammar Box teach the same focus
- [ ] At least one recycle of a prior tense/structure appears in dialogue or listening

## App behavior
- [ ] Unique `localStorage` key for this class
- [ ] Check Dialogue sticky in Section 4; Check Score + Show Answers sticky in Section 7
- [ ] No auto `scrollIntoView` on check
- [ ] Hints use `\u` escapes for Slovak diacritics
- [ ] Copy Plain Text exports full lesson; Copy Gap Fill uses blank templates
- [ ] Hub `index.html` lists the class with correct relative URL

## Pedagogy smoke test
- [ ] A grade 8–9 student can finish main tasks in one online hour
- [ ] Instructions are short; Slovak tips only where scoring/hints need them
- [ ] About Me / personal output tasks do not require private data beyond school-safe intro
